<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.51 pct, 3-mo 21.11 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.51 pct, 3-mo 21.11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) moved higher on Wednesday for both the one-month and three-month maturities edging higher, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 21.51 percent, up 0.01, with the three-month rate at 21.11 percent, up 0.05, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
